  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1967</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1686</mn><mi>i</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> contains exactly one positive integer <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> is",
    "image": null
  },
